{
    "title": "AfterShip Package Tracker - Tr",
    "description": "Download the AfterShip package tracker app to track all your online orders and shipments!\r\n \r\nYou can use our shipment tracker for all deliveries with every local and international carrier including the Post, DHL, UPS, FedEx, DPD, USPS, etc.\r\n \r\nTracking packages and deliveries of online shopping orders can't get easier than this. AfterShip is an easy-to-use package tracker with which you will know when your parcel will arrive. Check the delivery status of your parcels from Amazon shipping, eBay, AliExpress, and others only in a few clicks.\r\n \r\nWith our package tracker, you can check the delivery status of your shipping order across 700+ couriers worldwide at any point in its route. Be informed when the shipment will reach your destination with fast delivery notifications. \r\n \r\nFeatures:\r\n \r\n\u2022 Free shipment tracking with our order tracker\r\n\u2022 Free push notifications for 8 major order delivery statuses\r\n\u2022 No ads in our package tracking app\r\n\u2022 Auto-detect courier with the shipping label\r\n\u2022Track your packages and deliveries by scanning the barcode in our shipment tracker\r\n\u2022 Auto-detect carrier based on tracking number format of the package delivery\r\n\u2022 Easily copy/paste tracking number of orders\r\n\u2022 Easy-to-share tracking links with our order tracker\r\n\u2022 Auto-Import Amazon shipping, Etsy, and Walmart orders\r\n\u2022 Gmail sync / forward: shipment tracker that gets everything from your Gmail\r\n \r\nPush notifications with the updated order delivery status:\r\n\u2022 Info Received - Courier has received a shipping request from the shipper\r\n\u2022 In-Transit - Shipment on the way\r\n\u2022 Out for Delivery - Order is out for delivery\r\n\u2022 Delivered - Shipment is delivered\r\n\u2022 Failed Attempt - Courier tried to deliver the package but failed\r\n\u2022 Exception - Package delivery failed due to some shipping exception\r\n \r\nTrack your packages and deliveries in our order tracker across 700+ carriers for FREE! Just enter the tracking number and we will auto-detect the carriers for effortless tracking.\r\n \r\nCheck where your parcel from Amazon shipping, eBay, AliExpress, and others is at any time. Receive delivery notifications for every shipping label you enter in the AfterShip package tracker.\r\n \r\nTracking packages for every shipping delivery you are expecting from popular carriers like the Post, DHL, USPS, Blue Dart, FedEx, and UPS is easy with the AfterShip package tracker. \r\nhttps://www.capterra.com/p/178663/AfterShip/#about\r\nAfterShip package tracker currently supports 700+ carriers in our order tracker app (find the full list below).\r\n- FedEx\r\n- China EMS (ePacket)\r\n- China Post\r\n- DHL, DHL Express, DHL Global Forwarding, DHL Benelux, DHL Poland, DHL Netherlands\r\n- Canada Post\r\n- Aramex\r\n- Australia Post\r\n- UPS, UPS Freight, UPS Mail Innovations\r\n- USPS\r\n- Bpost\r\n- Belpost\r\n- Bluedart\r\n- Delhivery\r\n- DPD, DPD Germany, DPD UK, DPD Ireland, DPD Poland\r\n- Hermes, Hermes Germany\r\n- India Post\r\n- New Zealand Post\r\n- Parcelforce\r\n- Purolator\r\n- UK Mail\r\n- SEUR\r\n- SF Express, SF Express International\r\n- Singapore Post\r\n- TNT\r\n- Yanwen\r\n- Yodel\r\n \r\nEnter in our package tracker the tracking number you received from Amazon shipping, eBay AliExpress, and others for your parcel and track your packages and deliveries at any time. Know when your parcel will arrive and with which carrier - it is easy to check the delivery status with the AfterShip package delivery tracker at any point in its route.\r\n \r\nFind the carrier you need with the autodetect feature of our package tracker and know when your parcel will arrive with the Post, DHL, Australia Post, UPS, FedEx, DPD, China Post, etc. Tracking packages is a cakewalk with the AfterShip package tracker.\r\n\r\n\r\nHelp us to improve. Please leave us a positive review if you have a great experience using our package tracker.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Download the AfterShip package tracker app to track all your online orders and shipments!<br> <br>You can use our shipment tracker for all deliveries with every local and international carrier including the Post, DHL, UPS, FedEx, DPD, USPS, etc.<br> <br>Tracking packages and deliveries of online shopping orders can&#39;t get easier than this. AfterShip is an easy-to-use package tracker with which you will know when your parcel will arrive. Check the delivery status of your parcels from Amazon shipping, eBay, AliExpress, and others only in a few clicks.<br> <br>With our package tracker, you can check the delivery status of your shipping order across 700+ couriers worldwide at any point in its route. Be informed when the shipment will reach your destination with fast delivery notifications. <br> <br>Features:<br> <br>\u2022 Free shipment tracking with our order tracker<br>\u2022 Free push notifications for 8 major order delivery statuses<br>\u2022 No ads in our package tracking app<br>\u2022 Auto-detect courier with the shipping label<br>\u2022Track your packages and deliveries by scanning the barcode in our shipment tracker<br>\u2022 Auto-detect carrier based on tracking number format of the package delivery<br>\u2022 Easily copy/paste tracking number of orders<br>\u2022 Easy-to-share tracking links with our order tracker<br>\u2022 Auto-Import Amazon shipping, Etsy, and Walmart orders<br>\u2022 Gmail sync / forward: shipment tracker that gets everything from your Gmail<br> <br>Push notifications with the updated order delivery status:<br>\u2022 Info Received - Courier has received a shipping request from the shipper<br>\u2022 In-Transit - Shipment on the way<br>\u2022 Out for Delivery - Order is out for delivery<br>\u2022 Delivered - Shipment is delivered<br>\u2022 Failed Attempt - Courier tried to deliver the package but failed<br>\u2022 Exception - Package delivery failed due to some shipping exception<br> <br>Track your packages and deliveries in our order tracker across 700+ carriers for FREE! Just enter the tracking number and we will auto-detect the carriers for effortless tracking.<br> <br>Check where your parcel from Amazon shipping, eBay, AliExpress, and others is at any time. Receive delivery notifications for every shipping label you enter in the AfterShip package tracker.<br> <br>Tracking packages for every shipping delivery you are expecting from popular carriers like the Post, DHL, USPS, Blue Dart, FedEx, and UPS is easy with the AfterShip package tracker. <br>https://www.capterra.com/p/178663/AfterShip/#about<br>AfterShip package tracker currently supports 700+ carriers in our order tracker app (find the full list below).<br>- FedEx<br>- China EMS (ePacket)<br>- China Post<br>- DHL, DHL Express, DHL Global Forwarding, DHL Benelux, DHL Poland, DHL Netherlands<br>- Canada Post<br>- Aramex<br>- Australia Post<br>- UPS, UPS Freight, UPS Mail Innovations<br>- USPS<br>- Bpost<br>- Belpost<br>- Bluedart<br>- Delhivery<br>- DPD, DPD Germany, DPD UK, DPD Ireland, DPD Poland<br>- Hermes, Hermes Germany<br>- India Post<br>- New Zealand Post<br>- Parcelforce<br>- Purolator<br>- UK Mail<br>- SEUR<br>- SF Express, SF Express International<br>- Singapore Post<br>- TNT<br>- Yanwen<br>- Yodel<br> <br>Enter in our package tracker the tracking number you received from Amazon shipping, eBay AliExpress, and others for your parcel and track your packages and deliveries at any time. Know when your parcel will arrive and with which carrier - it is easy to check the delivery status with the AfterShip package delivery tracker at any point in its route.<br> <br>Find the carrier you need with the autodetect feature of our package tracker and know when your parcel will arrive with the Post, DHL, Australia Post, UPS, FedEx, DPD, China Post, etc. Tracking packages is a cakewalk with the AfterShip package tracker.<br><br><br>Help us to improve. Please leave us a positive review if you have a great experience using our package tracker.",
